WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.933
KATE BISHOP
Some people have actually called me

00:00:01.983 --> 00:00:03.000
the world's greatest archer.

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:04.709
[Bells ringing]

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:06.397
KATE BISHOP
Whoa! Oh, my God.

00:00:08.155 --> 00:00:09.326
CLINT BARTON
Are you one of those people?

00:00:10.022 --> 00:00:11.441
HAILEE STEINFELD
Finding the banter between

00:00:11.491 --> 00:00:12.527
Clint and Kate...

00:00:12.577 --> 00:00:13.399
CLINT BARTON
Where are you?

00:00:13.449 --> 00:00:15.079
KATE BISHOP
Oh, relax. I'm taking the elevator.

00:00:15.129 --> 00:00:16.745
HAILEE STEINFELD
...came pretty naturally.

00:00:20.379 --> 00:00:21.641
KATE BISHOP
I'm surprisingly capable.

00:00:21.691 --> 00:00:22.290
CLINT BARTON
Yeah.

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:23.501
BERT
Their chemistry was so on.

00:00:23.551 --> 00:00:24.235
[Laughing]

00:00:24.285 --> 00:00:25.508
KATE BISHOP
We're communicating.

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:26.623
We're listening.

00:00:26.673 --> 00:00:27.068
CLINT BARTON
What?

00:00:27.118 --> 00:00:27.779
[Laughing]

00:00:27.829 --> 00:00:29.006
BERTIE
They can bicker and have you

00:00:29.056 --> 00:00:31.115
giggling behind the monitors.
But then you see them

00:00:31.165 --> 00:00:33.432
in action sequences
and it's just lightning.

00:00:35.072 --> 00:00:36.818
JEREMY RENNER
The intersection of those two characters

00:00:36.868 --> 00:00:39.839
becomes, really, the big base
of what this show is about.

00:00:39.889 --> 00:00:43.964
I begrudgingly have her as a partner, if
you will. And then our friendship grows.

00:00:44.014 --> 00:00:46.529
We certainly get our
butt kicked all over this show.

00:00:47.749 --> 00:00:49.746
RHYS THOMAS
I enjoyed the humor and the tone

00:00:49.796 --> 00:00:51.561
in the twists and
turns that it takes.

00:00:52.045 --> 00:00:53.175
HAILEE STEINFELD
Collaborating with Jeremy,

00:00:53.225 --> 00:00:56.894
it requires a lot more strength
than I think it looks like it might.

00:00:56.944 --> 00:00:57.790
JEREMY RENNER
A lot.

00:01:01.044 --> 00:01:02.011
CLINT BARTON
Definitely not this one.

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:02.925
KATE BISHOP
You don't have to say "definitely"

00:01:02.975 --> 00:01:03.709
like that.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.111
HAILEE STEINFELD
It's been such a wild ride.

00:01:06.561 --> 00:01:10.518
You have no idea. This is literally just
the bare bones of what this is gonna be.

00:01:10.569 --> 00:01:11.384
CLINT BISHOP
Bang!

00:01:11.435 --> 00:01:12.177
KATE BISHOP
Holy sh--!

00:01:12.227 --> 00:01:13.458
Your problem is branding.

00:01:13.508 --> 00:01:14.747
CLINT BARTON
No, my problem is you.

00:01:14.797 --> 00:01:15.474
[Laughing]

